{"4752590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tiny Heist", "steam_appid": 4752590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You are tiny. The house is massive. The cat is hunting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Heist</strong> is a chaotic online co-op stealth heist game where you and your crew play as miniature thieves breaking into a giant modern house. Pull off risky <strong>day and night heists</strong>, steal valuables, dodge deadly household hazards, and escape before the homeowner catches you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752590/extras/9c1b126273f2689347ce68c243b4b176.poster.avif?t=1781227532\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752590/extras/9c1b126273f2689347ce68c243b4b176.webm?t=1781227532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752590/extras/9c1b126273f2689347ce68c243b4b176.mp4?t=1781227532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room is a dangerous playground. Sofas become mountains, kitchen counters become escape routes, robot vacuums become death traps, and the family cat becomes a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan the job. Grab the loot. Stay quiet. Get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Online Co-op</strong><br>Team up with friends and pull off chaotic heists inside oversized household environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752590/extras/991f69be4d04079c140348406f1540ed.poster.avif?t=1781227532\" width=1170 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752590/extras/991f69be4d04079c140348406f1540ed.webm?t=1781227532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752590/extras/991f69be4d04079c140348406f1540ed.mp4?t=1781227532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day and Night Heists</strong><br>Rob bright daytime rooms or sneak through darker, more dangerous night missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steal, Hide, and Escape</strong><br>Search for valuables, carry loot back to safety, and decide whether to escape or risk going deeper into the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Giant House Full of Threats</strong><br>Explore massive rooms from a miniature perspective while avoiding cats, creatures, robot vacuums, noisy traps, falling objects, and other deadly household dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Homeowner Encounters</strong><br>The homeowner can enter at any moment, turning a quiet heist into a desperate fight to stay hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752590/extras/5a8c1102142db9b4b2d9dc05c36a8a4f.poster.avif?t=1781227532\" width=1170 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752590/extras/5a8c1102142db9b4b2d9dc05c36a8a4f.webm?t=1781227532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752590/extras/5a8c1102142db9b4b2d9dc05c36a8a4f.mp4?t=1781227532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth-Based Teamwork</strong><br>Scout ahead, warn your crew, distract threats, move loot together, and survive the heist as a team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You are tiny. The house is massive. The cat is hunting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Heist</strong> is a chaotic online co-op stealth heist game where you and your crew play as miniature thieves breaking into a giant modern house. Pull off risky <strong>day and night heists</strong>, steal valuables, dodge deadly household hazards, and escape before the homeowner catches you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752590/extras/9c1b126273f2689347ce68c243b4b176.poster.avif?t=1781227532\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752590/extras/9c1b126273f2689347ce68c243b4b176.webm?t=1781227532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4752590/extras/9c1b126273f2689347ce68c243b4b176.mp4?t=1781227532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room is a dangerous playground. Sofas become mountains, kitchen counters become escape routes, robot vacuums become death traps, and the family cat becomes a nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan the job. Grab the loot. Stay quiet. Get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Player Online Co-op</strong><br>Team up with friends and pull off chaotic heists inside oversized household environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st